!Sample_data_processing = Raw reads were counted across all individual exons and repeat elements and subsequently merged by corresponsing ensembl gene or repeat masker subfamily annotation. Differential gene and subfamily expression was called using DESeq2.
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: mm10
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: Excel file contains read coverage and DESeq2 differential expression statistics for all Ensemble genes (mm10) and repetitive elements (by subfamily annotation). Each siRNA treatment condition (siChaf1a, siChaf1a +si308, siChaf1a +si309) was compared in a pairwise manner to mESCs treated only with negative control siRNA (NC).
